pt></span></div></div><div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text line-clamp-5 text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">用过微信 ClawBot (iLink Bot API)的都知道，
1. 你无法将任何聊天记录，合并转发给ClawBot
2. 你跟ClawBot的聊天记录，也无法合并转发给别人

这其实是微信在AI Agent这件事上的最核心关键突破口，
但却几乎没有人提及。

因为多选聊天记录合并转发（双向 Input/Output）
=AI</span> <button class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-normal text-brand hover:underline" type="button">Show more</button></div></div></div></article></div></div><div class="flex shrink items-center text-gray-700"><span class="inline-flex w-fit"><a id="_R_bqppimb6b5336_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-gray-700 text-body font-normal hover:underline inline-flex w-fit" href="/coolish/status/2050897352710566376">11:16 AM · May 3, 2026</a><script nonce="nV0/VHPB/3FNZrhJtDJxbw==">window.__xClientTextFormatters?.run("_R_bqppimb6b5336_", "formatFullTimestamp", {"timestamp":1777807007000,"lang":"en","nowLabel":"Now"});</script></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 px-1 last:hidden">·</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-subtext1 font-[inherit] font-chirp inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-gray-700 active" id="base-ui-_R_3uppimb6b5336_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger="" href="/coolish/status/2050897352710566376" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><div class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-bold text-primary">25.6K</div><div class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-normal text-gray-700">Views</div></a></div></div><div class="border-border my-2 border-t"></div><div class="-mx-2 flex h-5 min-h-5 w-[calc(100%+16px)] items-center justify-between overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1" data-engagement-action="reply"><a class="max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] group inline-flex items-center rounded-full transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 hover:text-blue-500 text-secondary" aria-label="Reply" href="/coolish/status/2050897352710566376"><span class="relative isolate inline-flex items-center rounded-full before:-z-10 before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:ins